Tool Name	Version	Introduction
SAW	v1.0	STOmics Analysis Workflow is a workflow dedicated to processing BGI STOmics data, including quality control, genome alignment, quantification of gene expression, and visualization of results.
Seurat	v4.0.0	Seurat is an R package dedicated to single-cell sequencing analysis and STOmics sequencing analysis. Its functions cover data filtering, data standardization, de-batch effect, cell clustering analysis, differential gene analysis, etc., with comprehensive and powerful functions.
SingleR	v1.6.1	SingleR is an R package for cell type annotation of single cell sequencing data and spatiotemporal group data, mainly through comparison with the reference data set score, according to the score matrix to obtain the final annotation result.
SciBet	v1.0	SciBet is an R package for cell type annotation of single cell sequencing data and spatiotemporal group data. It mainly uses a supervised approach to model the different cell types in the data set separately and estimates the annotation results using maximum likelihood method.
CellChat	v1.0.0	CellChat is a tool capable of quantitatively inferring and analyzing cell-to-cell communication networks from single-cell data, using network analysis and pattern recognition methods to predict the main signal inputs and outputs of cells and how these cells and signals coordinate their functions.
clusterProfiler	v4.0.0	ClusterProfiler is an R package used for gene enrichment analysis of various methods, such as GO, KEGG, etc., and can realize the visualization of the results of enrichment analysis.
Monocle3	v1.0.0	Monocle3 is an R package used for pseudo-time analysis. According to the differential expression of genes among different cell groups, the results of cell lineage development are obtained, and the change trajectory of cells with a virtual time sequence is constructed, so as to reproduce the change process of cells over time.
